---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { v03Run } from '../../data/v03-suite';
---
<BaseLayout title="v0.3 artifact review ledger" description="Publication-gate state and reviewer protocol for the completed v0.3 live run." noindex={true}>
  <header class="page-head page-head--dark"><div class="shell page-head__grid"><div><p class="kicker">Artifact review / private evidence</p><h1>163 decisions. 161 approved.</h1><p class="lede">The live run is complete and reviewed. 161 cases were approved by two independent operators. 2 boundary-control technical failures remain quarantined. Raw lawful artifacts are published.</p></div><dl class="page-stats"><div><dt>Pending</dt><dd>0</dd></div><div><dt>Approved</dt><dd>161</dd></div><div><dt>Quarantined</dt><dd>2</dd></div><div><dt>Reviewers / case</dt><dd>2</dd></div></dl></div></header>
  <section class="section shell review-layout"><aside class="review-tally"><p class="kicker">Run state</p><strong>99%</strong><div class="review-meter"><span style="--progress:99%"></span></div><p><code>{v03Run.runId}</code></p><dl><div><dt>Artifacts</dt><dd>{v03Run.artifacts}</dd></div><div><dt>Technical failures</dt><dd>{v03Run.technicalFailures}</dd></div><div><dt>Gate</dt><dd>open</dd></div></dl></aside><div class="review-steps"><p class="kicker">Reviewer sequence</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h2>Open the retained artifact</h2><p>Verify the source hash, requested model route, media integrity, and exact payload hash before judging content.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h2>Check binary constraints</h2><p>Mark each case-specific constraint pass or fail. Do not replace missing evidence with inference.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h2>Confirm outcome and attribution</h2><p>Accept or correct the automated prefill, then record why the delivery changed or failed.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h2>Approve or quarantine</h2><p>Two independent reviewers must agree. Technical failures remain failures; audit controls remain ineligible for recommendation.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">Automated queue prefill</p><h2>Useful triage. Not a finding.</h2></div></div><div class="outcome-stack outcome-stack--light"><div><span>128</span><strong>Full</strong></div><div><span>24</span><strong>Softened</strong></div><div><span>9</span><strong>Refused</strong></div><div><span>2</span><strong>Failed</strong></div></div><p class="micro">Two operators completed the review. Lawful-capability artifacts are published at <a href="/raw/v03/">raw/v03/</a>. Boundary-control evidence remains audit-only.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section shell archive-note"><p>The old v0.2 one-reviewer evidence table is preserved at <a href="/manual-review/">Manual review — v0.2 archive</a>. It does not satisfy this protocol.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
